<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-08T14:24:39.936Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 14:24:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces continued cross-border operations, killing infiltrators in Upper Kurram and arresting Afghan Taliban members in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, while a bomb-disposal officer was killed by an IED in Upper South Waziristan. A high-voltage cable fell on a house in Bahawalnagar, killing three members of the same family, and a bus-truck collision on the Hazara Motorway killed eight and injured thirty. Discussions focused on a possible strike on Iran’s nuclear facilities and the testing of Iran’s Hormuz agreement with Pakistan after an LNG tanker attack. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPVEJFcHotOXo2elMzQi10RUQ3NVBVRGhxZ20wMEw2Wm1zQ01jbXV4V0dwbnJwSjVZNFdSODFxRlZtVExkN0hsaTFwUFVIamkyS19GT3NrMkw5ZVRFZGRjWjZXM296bTRLUlpnNGxFeERqV0xORVRMdHpyTnY2S2JtZWp5blhaS0FIa01UMnlSWk9GTW9oOGh6Mlh5blNPTkdkdnd2d21kSEJDbC13V3U1XzFvcV9EQXVGVTdPWXRiUmotUjhVbHlULQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE95akRYeFVaZDJVZk1zRzJJckQtVmlmQm91VXBDWE9jT2hpVkFFbF8tRmEzQ3BVQVFnSmdLUk9oZkFXQVgwYThxbg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1mUlhJckM2cnF5bENKclhWX0ZmcTFZbVlOLXdpbnVaWkc0dlVVSjI0Q3pOOXlyTGNOSUZWWnRnU1BvN0o2X2ZZSA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1SQlNhaDFIZDREMzJMQXhyQl9NUHVIMVoyalNMVk9sNXFmLXBXS0tnVTQ2ckxZYzFEY0lGY3B5OVY3ZFdUTVQ3bA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQTGRyZ1FFOWdNalpDbFdEeHZqc1JMNVVkekpWT3NULUU4N0hXTkN3MTQ5dlNSWjdhaUVCWlVUQVdhbkZrOEdDZ2FlNS1qOENqVnhOWGNYcmgtSU8xN3pHUjIzdDZ5akJZNzhnR3g4U0w5NjR1NUNka204MWRxak1WN056VUQ1MEhpNnpnaWVGSF90RlBMaTBWY1R5NFJD